\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces 2D power spectrum of samples from 2D CDF inversion, plain per-pixel alias, and our LeafAlias, from the same Halton input. Per-pixel alias shows a sharp, isolated off-axis peak (flatness 0.270, peak/median 16{,}113), a periodic banding artifact from its flat array index resonating with the input sequence's base-2 digit structure. {\unhbox \voidb@x \color  {revcolor}The per-pixel table is built here with the textbook construction of Algorithm\nonbreakingspace \ref {alg:build}. Neither CDF inversion nor ours shows such a peak; Appendix\nonbreakingspace \ref {app:qmc} repeats the test with the table construction of our renderer.}}}{3}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:spectrum}{{3}{3}{2D power spectrum of samples from 2D CDF inversion, plain per-pixel alias, and our LeafAlias, from the same Halton input. Per-pixel alias shows a sharp, isolated off-axis peak (flatness 0.270, peak/median 16{,}113), a periodic banding artifact from its flat array index resonating with the input sequence's base-2 digit structure. \rev {The per-pixel table is built here with the textbook construction of Algorithm~\ref {alg:build}. Neither CDF inversion nor ours shows such a peak; Appendix~\ref {app:qmc} repeats the test with the table construction of our renderer.}}{figure.caption.7}{}}
